Package: com.551.topdownnotifications16
Name: TopDownNotifications16
Version: 1.1.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: iOS 14-style notifications on iOS 16. Notifications start at the top and stack downward while forcing the lock-screen notification display into List mode so notifications are not hidden behind the iOS 16 Stack/Count pile.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/551UK/TopDownNotifications16
